Package: base-files
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Essential: yes
Priority: required
Description: root layout, /etc defaults and licence texts
 The root's directories. /etc, /tmp and /var are links into /private.
 The defaults in /etc. init runs /etc/rc at boot.
 The texts of the longer licences, in /usr/share/common-licenses.
